<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0579_T24R0701_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You came from Olivine?\rYou remember the four islands on the\nway?\rA mythical sea creature hidin’ in ’em.\nOr my ex. One of them two.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0579_T24R0701_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard you can only see it if you got\na Silver Wing.\rIt smell like the creature. I sniffed\nit. Don’t ask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0579_T24R0701_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you just walk in?! This a\nhouse, not a Poké Center!\rThe whirlpools round the islands come\nfrom the sea creature.\rIt’s just spinnin’ in there. Like me\nafter a breakup.</language>
	</row>
</body>
